akthrough about Guru and his motives!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/78hlB5TY4qeNNbjoGL2FrODqEC6.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9DaXRhZGVsLUhvbmV5LUJ1bm55LTIwMjQv.1.5","title":"Traitor","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2024-11-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"1992: Honey’s world is turned upside down when she discovers the agency she once trusted is not who they claim to be, forcing her to take a drastic step, risking everyone’s lives. 2000: Bunny plots Honey’s next step, as drastic as the one she took in the past.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xYcfwll9ivtOXZyhc9nehHRHPiW.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9DaXRhZGVsLUhvbmV5LUJ1bm55LTIwMjQv.1.6","title":"Play","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2024-11-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"2000: As things come to a head, Honey and Bunny join forces to unleash their full might, fighting for love, family, and their daughter's future. As KD decides to take matters into his own hands, the ensuing battle tests their resilience, leaving the future uncertain.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rmWQEA0xOp9Rd6shDHMeueTkXn5.jpg"}]}}